anning; planned, active, done, and skipped block states; actual-time recording, shutdown notes, and journaling.</li><li>Desktop weekly calendar and mobile single-day timeline, plus dashboard, routine builder, goals, account, and onboarding interfaces.</li><li>Drizzle ORM data model and APIs for authentication, goals, routines, day plans, block updates, and token-managed public read-only summaries. Cookie sessions for web and bearer tokens for mobile.</li><li>Technology: Next.js 15, React 19, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, Drizzle ORM, Tailwind CSS, Expo, React Native, Expo Router, JWT.</li></ul></LocalizedProjectDetails></details></TiltCard>
